# P19 on Android: items chosen from the flat menu, by label. The menu is a platform PopupMenu; FrontWindows finds it
# through WindowInspector (1ba5e444), so taplabel reaches its rows.
# Pass: after the toggle, "toggle item -> true"; after the second open, "last action -> second button item".
# The text item is not clickable and is not pressed. P19-open-the-flat-menu keeps the capture of the open menu.
# P19 在 Android 上：以文字從扁平選單選項目。通過:toggle item -> true,last action -> second button item。
